// The walk on stars' matching schedule with the points claimed by sixteen
// persistent workers from a counter instead of TBB's partition, the workers
// on the threads; WoSX has no persistent CPU solver, so the reference is its
// threaded solve again, as fcpwb-persistent.bonsai is for the walk on
// spheres. The traversals are cpu/wost_fcpwb.bonsai's, FCPW's CPU order,
// the one-thread schedule's.
import apps/wosx/schedules/cpu/wost_fcpwb;

schedule {
    solve_stars.persistent(i, t, 16);
    solve_stars.bind(t, CPUThread);
}
